# CLUSTER run (2026-11-09; user: "reduce 10 critic to 1", then "use same number standard
# critics use"): slurm/sac_c0_plain_rs10_rw_projbc.env -- the two-town plain-SAC fine-tune
# of c0 with the critic's 50-d projection head pretrained by imitation on the demos and
# frozen -- with standard SAC's TWIN critics instead of REDQ's ten: N_CRITICS=2 and
# SUBSET_SIZE=2 (the target is the min of both) and ACTOR_Q_REDUCE=min (the policy loss
# reads min(Q1, Q2)), as in Haarnoja et al. 2018. The pretrained head is copied into both
# critics and their targets and frozen there.
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_c0_plain_rs10_rw_projbc.env"
export N_CRITICS=2 SUBSET_SIZE=2 ACTOR_Q_REDUCE=min
